  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to increase human rights and social justice in East   Africa. The support is rendered to an Human Rights fund based in      Nairobi, which in turn gives grants to small organization based in    the region whith operations in the HR-area.HR and social justice      through innovative methods incl ICT. Continued support to             contribution 54030048</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka m&#xe4;nksliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och social r&#xe4;ttvisa  i &#xf6;stafrika. St&#xf6;det ges till en MR-organisation i Nairobi som         vidaref&#xf6;rmedlar medel till mindre lokala organisationer i regionen i  syfte att st&#xe4;rka dessa och arbetet kring MR.MR fr&#xe5;gor och social      r&#xe4;ttvisa gm innovativa metoder inkl ICT. Fortsatt st&#xf6;d av instats     54030048.</narrative>
  </description>
